      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785607012612,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Las Vegas algo\n\n    - Always returns the correct answer\n    - Randomness only affects how long it takes",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Las Vegas algo\n\n    - Always returns the correct answer\n    - Randomness only affects how long it takes",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "SYxJlmuettegiIDtojdAM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9127.980916759536,
      "y": 14975.546152175715,
      "width": 628.1442368775204,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 90,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0r",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1721355204,
      "version": 629,
      "versionNonce": 70831744,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785607012612,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Example: Randomized Quicksort. It randomly chooses a pivot,\nbut the final array is always sorted correctly. The running time\nmay vary.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Example: Randomized Quicksort. It randomly chooses a pivot, but the final array is always sorted correctly. The running time may vary.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "TDDE0RthiqTVJZWGxte-8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9119.9786590069,
      "y": 15070.153686949718,
      "width": 678.2306072535404,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 90,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0s",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2066077820,
      "version": 632,
      "versionNonce": 1851840896,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785607256377,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Monte Carlo algorithm\n\n    - Has a predictable or limited running time.\n    - It may return an incorrect answer with a small probability.\n\nExample: The Miller–Rabin primality test.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Monte Carlo algorithm\n\n    - Has a predictable or limited running time.\n    - It may return an incorrect answer with a small probability.\n\nExample: The Miller–Rabin primality test.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
