      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "c)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "lGAXvZJmTz5ThcjlYe7ky",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9151.517289507578,
      "y": 13504.983435746166,
      "width": 669.4030504455561,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 90,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 464608896,
      "version": 404,
      "versionNonce": 1585224064,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785606997863,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For t > 0:\n    P(S >= a) = P(e^(tS) >= e^(ta))\n\nUsing Markov's inequality:\n\n    P(S >= a) <= E[e^(tS)] / e^(ta)\n\nSince E[e^(tS)] = M_S(t):\n\n    P(S >= a) <= e^(-ta)(1 - p + pe^t)^n\n\nBecause t is a free parameter, choose the positive value of t that\nmakes the bound as small as possible\n\n    \n\nThe role of t is to tighten the bound. Different values of t give\ndifferent upper bounds, so we choose the value that gives the\nsmallest bound.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For t > 0:\n    P(S >= a) = P(e^(tS) >= e^(ta))\n\nUsing Markov's inequality:\n\n    P(S >= a) <= E[e^(tS)] / e^(ta)\n\nSince E[e^(tS)] = M_S(t):\n\n    P(S >= a) <= e^(-ta)(1 - p + pe^t)^n\n\nBecause t is a free parameter, choose the positive value of t that makes the bound as small as possible\n\n    \n\nThe role of t is to tighten the bound. Different values of t give different upper bounds, so we choose the value that gives the smallest bound.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "j5Ivey88NLAfY6NKbjJyU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9326.031075009634,
      "y": 13847.052431237795,
      "width": 18.6024458967629,
      "height": 18.352871930327538,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
